              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Naye ggwe weetegeke! Yimirira obabuulire byonna bye nkulagira. Tobatya kubanga bw'onoobatya nzija kubakutiisa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
